    <string name="health_rationale_title">HeavyDuty and Health Connect</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_text">HeavyDuty uses Health Connect only if you connect it in Profile, and only for this:\n\n• Writing your finished workouts (name, start and duration) as strength training sessions. If you edit a workout\'s duration or delete it in HeavyDuty, it\'s updated there too.\n\n• Reading your body weight, from your scale or other apps, to show it in your progress.\n\nHeavyDuty doesn\'t send this data to any server: it stays on your phone. You can remove the permissions at any time in Health Connect, or stop syncing with “Disconnect” in Profile.</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_close">Got it</string>
